---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /gallery/
title: "Before & After Gallery"
heroEyebrow: "Results"
heroTitle: "Before &amp; after gallery"
heroSubtitle: "Drag each slider to compare. Photos are shared with patient consent, and every result is individual."
seo:
  title: "Before & After Photos | Dr. Junaid Fateh, Lahore"
  description: "Before and after results for hair transplant, gynecomastia, liposuction and more by Dr. Junaid Fateh, plastic surgeon in Lahore and Layyah."
  keywords: "before and after plastic surgery Lahore, hair transplant before after Lahore, gynecomastia before after, liposuction before after Lahore, Dr Junaid Fateh results"
---
{%- set crumbs = [{ name: "Before & After" }] -%}
{% include "partials/page-hero.njk" %}
{%- set results = collections.procedures | allResults -%}

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="filter-bar" data-filter-group="#gallery-grid" role="group" aria-label="Filter by category">
      <button type="button" class="is-active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
      {% for cat in collections.categories %}{% if (results | where("category", cat.fileSlug)).length %}<button type="button" data-filter="{{ cat.fileSlug }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ cat.data.nav_title }}</button>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="ba-list ba-list--grid" id="gallery-grid">
      {% for pair in results %}
      <div class="gallery-item" data-filter-item="{{ pair.category }}">
        {% set label = pair.procedure %}{% include "partials/before-after.njk" %}
        <p class="small" style="margin-top:.5rem"><a href="{{ pair.url }}">About {{ pair.procedure }} <i class="fas fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="note" style="margin-top:2rem"><i class="fas fa-circle-info" aria-hidden="true"></i> Results vary between individuals and depend on anatomy, healing and aftercare. Dr. Junaid will discuss what is realistic for you at your consultation.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta-band.njk" %}
